The '''Hutt Palace'''<ref name="Databank" /> was located on the [[planet]] [[Nal Hutta]] and was the residence of [[the Twins]]. It was destroyed by [[New Republic Defense Fleet Starfighter Corps]] [[pilot]]s during the [[Battle of Nal Hutta (Din Djarin)|Battle of Nal Hutta]].<ref name="MaG" />

